"Johnny" "Lotto's up to twelve million." "audio/dialogue/johnny_lotto/take_01/balanced/01_johnny.wav" 1.000 2.980
"Lou" "Don't waste your money." "audio/dialogue/johnny_lotto/take_01/balanced/02_lou.wav" 4.180 2.030
"Johnny" "Somebody's gotta win." "audio/dialogue/johnny_lotto/take_01/balanced/03_johnny.wav" 6.410 1.830
"Lou" "I hit it once. Never played again." "audio/dialogue/johnny_lotto/take_01/balanced/04_lou.wav" 8.440 3.380
"Johnny" "You? How much?" "audio/dialogue/johnny_lotto/take_01/balanced/05_johnny.wav" 12.020 2.730
"Lou" "Enough to buy this place." "audio/dialogue/johnny_lotto/take_01/balanced/06_lou.wav" 14.950 3.180
"Johnny" "No shit. What'd you do, pick birthdays?" "audio/dialogue/johnny_lotto/take_01/balanced/07_johnny.wav" 18.330 3.780
"Lou" "Didn't pick numbers. Picked a truck." "audio/dialogue/johnny_lotto/take_01/balanced/08_lou.wav" 22.310 3.730
"Johnny" "A truck?" "audio/dialogue/johnny_lotto/take_01/balanced/09_johnny.wav" 26.240 1.030
"Lou" "Had the bank's name on the side." "audio/dialogue/johnny_lotto/take_01/balanced/10_lou.wav" 27.470 3.230
"Johnny" "Right." "audio/dialogue/johnny_lotto/take_01/balanced/11_johnny.wav" 31.270 0.730
"Lou" "Anyway. I gotta go make a delivery." "audio/dialogue/johnny_lotto/take_01/balanced/12_lou.wav" 32.670 3.630
"Johnny" "Let me do it." "audio/dialogue/johnny_lotto/take_01/balanced/13_johnny.wav" 36.500 1.330
